      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹6.41 (vs ₹5.31 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹6.41 (up from ₹5.31 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹191.3m (down 3.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹32.4m (up 21% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 17% (up from 14% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 5% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 13% per year, which means it is performing significantly worse than earnings.",
